{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18884","headline":"同留守王仆射各赋春中一物从一韵至七 · 刘禹锡","name":"同留守王仆射各赋春中一物从一韵至七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莺，能语，多情。\n春将半，天欲明。\n始逢南陌，复集东城。\n林疎时见影，花密但闻声。\n营中缘催短笛，楼上来定哀筝。\n千门万户垂杨里，百转如簧烟景晴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}